WEBVTT

37:01.204 --> 37:02.914
do you want a man at your back?

37:03.039 --> 37:05.374
Or a sniveling boy?

37:13.132 --> 37:15.259
(SOBBING)

37:19.639 --> 37:22.433
You send this whore
to give me commands?

37:22.558 --> 37:25.144
I should have sent you back her head!

37:25.269 --> 37:27.522
Forgive me, Khaleesi.
I did as you asked.

37:27.647 --> 37:30.650
Hush now. It's all right.
Irri, take her and leave us.
